<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">2 Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Sal</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus, akiḏi Silas ḏ Timutawus, <char style="it">nura ṯabrat-a</char> ɣar jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Salunik <char style="it">iy yumnen</char> zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹiqab n Arebbi ḏi Yum n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Ay ayṯma, itxeṣṣa u labud a ncekkar Arebbi xawem ȓebda. Qa manaya nican minzi lʼiman nwem itemɣur s waṭṭas, minzi ƹaweḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem ṯarenni ak wayawya. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />X manaya ḏ kenniw ig iǧan ḏ ccan nneɣ jar ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin, nessawaȓ x ṣṣbar nwem ḏ lʼiman nwem ḏi marra aƹeddeb nni ḏ marra ȓemḥayen nni iy xawem iy tekken.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Manaya ḏ ijjen n ddalil belli lḥukem n Arebbi iǧa nican, u s ddalil-a akenniw iḥseb ṯesḏaheǧem ȓmulk nnes iy xef ṯƹeddbem. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Arebbi netta ḏ Bab n ȓḥaqq, aḏ iƹeddeb s ȓemḥayen yinni iy kenniw itmeḥḥanen, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />aḏawem yuc arraḥeṯ akiḏneɣ kenniw itwameḥḥanen. Manaya aḏ yiȓi xmi d ɣa imeḍhar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zeg ujenna ḏeg yijjen n ṯmessi ṯḥeddeq, akiḏes d meḍharent lmalaʼikaṯ nnes ijehḏen. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Aḏ intaqem zeg yinni war issinen ca Arebbi ḏ yinni war itṭiƹin ca i Lʼinjil n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Aḏ twaƹaqben s yijjen n lxarab war ifennin ca, aḏ twaḥarrmen zeg uɣembub n Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ lƹaḍama n jjheḏ nnes. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Manaya aḏ iwqeƹ ḏi Yum nni iy d ɣa yas Siḏiṯneɣ bac aḏ itwasemɣar jar ṣṣaliḥin nnes, netta azzayes tƹejjben marra yinni yumnen, ḏaysen kenniw minzi ṯumnem zi min xas necheḏ.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />X manaya ntettar i Arebbi xawem ȓebda bac akenniw yarr ṯesḏahǧem aȓaɣi nnes. U s jjheḏ nnes aḏawem yarew marra ȓxir iy ṯexsem aḏ teggem, aḏawem yarew kuȓ ȓxeḏmeṯ ƹaweḏ iy d tasen zi lʼiman nwem. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Ntettar-as manaya bac isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa aḏaywem itwasemɣar, aḏayes twamɣarem ƹaweḏ kenniw ƹlaḥsab arḍa n Arebbi nneɣ ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ddejjal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Amma Yum nni xmi d ɣa imeḍhar Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ neccin aɣares ngaƹƹeḏ. Ay ayṯma, neqqar-awem <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />war tenxȓiƹem ca ḏeɣya ḏi ȓaƹqeȓ nwem, war txeyyaqem ca ƹlaḥsab ca n arruḥ <char style="it">n lwaḥi</char> niɣ ḏ ca n wawaȓ niɣ ḏ ca n ṯebrat zzayneɣ zaƹma iqqaren qa Yum n Siḏiṯneɣ aqa yuweḍ-d. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Lla, war tejjam ḥadd akenniw icmeṯ s walu. Ataf war izemmar Yum nni aḏ d yas qbeȓ ma aḏ semḥen aṭṭas aṭṭas n yiwḏan ḏ amezwaru ḏi Arebbi aḏ d imeḍhar lmesxuṭ mmis n ȓefna. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Netta itƹarraḍ i Arebbi isemɣar ixef nnes x marra minxef iǧa isem n Arebbi ḏ min ƹebbḏen yiwḏan ḥetta aḏ iqqim ḏi Ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Arebbi aḏ iƹeyyeḍ aḏ yini qa nec ḏ Arebbi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ma war ṯeƹqiȓem ca? Iwa wami tuɣayi akiḏwem qbeȓ qqareɣ-awem ṯimesȓayin-a. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Kenniw ṯessnem min ṯ iteṭṭfen ƹaḏ bac war d itmeḍhar ca aȓ d ɣa yaweḍ ȓweqt nnes nican. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Cuf, ijjen n jjheḏ inuffaren n ssayyiʼaṯ ixeddem ȓexxu, walakin ḏinni ijjen nneɣni ƹaḏ iteṭṭef-iṯ ḥetta wanita nneɣni aḏ itwakkes zi ȓwesṭ. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ṯumma aḏ d imeḍhar lmesxuṭ, axas iṣuḍ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa s uqemmum nnes aṯ ineɣ, aṯ isbeṭṭeȓ s lƹaḍama nnes iy zi d ɣa iƹqeb Ƹisa. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Lmesxuṭ-a wanita aḏ d imeḍhar <char style="it">ḏi ddunect-a</char> ƹlaḥsab ȓexḏayem n Cciṭan s marra ṯizemmar ḏ lburhanaṯ ḏ ȓaƹjayeb isxarriqen <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />ḏ marra ibriḏen n ccarr iy zi twacemmaṯen yinni ifennan. Niṯni aḏ fnan minzi war qbiȓen ca aḏ texsen lḥaqiqa bac aṯen isenjem Arebbi. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />X manaya aḏ issekk Arebbi aṯen istexiyyal bac aḏ amnen s uxarriq-a. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ḥima aḏ twaḥasben marra yinni war yuminen ca s lḥaqiqa arḍan s ccarr.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ṯineggura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Fa ay ayṯma iy xef iƹizz Siḏiṯneɣ, labud a ncekkar Arebbi xawem minzi ixḍar-ikenniw ḏ imezwura nni iƹni ḏ yinni iy twasnejmen s ȓxeḏmeṯ nni issiṣfan n Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ yijjen ttiqeṯ nwem ḏi lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" /><char style="it">Aqa</char> iȓaɣa-d xawem ƹlaḥsab i manaya s Lʼinjil iy netbeccar bac aḏ tcarcem ḏi lƹaḍama n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Iḏen ay ayṯma, beddem nican, ṭṭfem ḏi ttaƹalim nni iy kenniw nseȓmeḏ waxxa s wawaȓ nneɣ waxxa s ṯebrat nneɣ.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16-17" />Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa s yixef nnes u ƹaweḏ Arebbi Babaṯneɣ wenni iy ḏaneɣ yucin s arḍa nnes ijjen n ucejjaƹ war ifennin ca ƹemmarṣ ḏ ijjen n lʼamal iṣbaḥ, ataf akenniw icejjeƹ s wuȓawen nwem aṯen isejheḏ ƹlaḥsab ḏi kuȓ ȓxeḏmeṯ ḏ kuȓ awaȓ aṣebḥan.<verse eid="2TH 2:16-17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Amma ṯimesȓayin nneɣni ay ayṯma, ttareṯ xaneɣ i Arebbi bac awaȓ n Siḏiṯneɣ aḏ itentacar aḏ itwasemɣar mammec iy iweqƹen jarawem. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Ttareṯ ƹaweḏ a nefȓeṯ zeg yiwḏan war iḥȓin ḏ iƹeffanen minzi lʼiman war iǧi ca ḏi marra iwḏan. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Walakin Siḏiṯneɣ ḏayes ttiqeṯ, akenniw isejheḏ akenniw iḥḍa zi ccarr. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Neccin qa metʼakkedin ḏi Siḏi Arebbi aqa minzi kenniw nweṣṣa qa teggem-ṯ, aṯ teggem ƹaḏ. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Aḏ issiweḍ Siḏiṯneɣ uȓawen nwem ɣar ȓemḥibbeṯ n Arebbi, ƹaweḏ ɣar ṣṣbar n Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Fa ay ayṯma, netweṣṣa-kenniw ƹlaḥsab isem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏ tbeƹƹḏem zi mkuȓ ȓmumen itbaƹen farq-ccɣeȓ, netta war iḏeffar ca ttaƹlim iy ṯqebȓem zzayneɣ. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Kenniw s yixef nwem ṯessnem u labud aḏ tebƹem abriḏ nni iy negga jarawem. Neccin war netbiƹ ca farq-ccɣeȓ wami tuɣaneɣ akiḏwem. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />War necci bu uɣrum ak ḥadd baṭeȓ. Lla, nxeddem ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar, neccaṯ tamara nrebbeȓ bac war netbessiȓ x ḥadd zzaywem. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Negga manayenni maci war ɣarneɣ bu ȓḥaqq aḏaneɣ ṯƹawnem; Lla, nseḍhar-awem-d abriḏ iy ɣa ṯeḏfarem. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Waxxa wami tuɣaneɣ akiḏwem nuca-awem ȓuṣiyeṯ-a ṯanita: Wenni itagin aḏ ixḏem war itett ca.<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Liʼanna netsȓa belli ḏinni ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem tbaƹen farq-ccɣeȓ. War xeddmen ca ccɣuȓaṯ nsen, niṯni taḏfen ḏi ccɣuȓaṯ n midden waha. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Iwḏan-a netweṣṣa-ṯen neqqar-asen s yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏ xeḏmen s lmaƹqul aḏ ccen aɣrum iy iǧan nsen. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Amma kenniw ay ayṯma, ggeṯ ȓxir bȓa ma aḏ taḥȓem.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Wenni war itṭiƹin ca i wawaȓ nneɣ ḏi ṯebrat-a ggem-ṯ ḏi ȓbaȓ nwem, war kiḏes ggurem ca bac aḏ iseḏḥa. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Walakin war ṯ twaȓam ca am ȓaƹḏu nwem; Lla, nham-ṯ am yijjen zeg wuwmaṯwem.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxiṭam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Siḏiṯneɣ n ȓehna aḏawem yuc ijjen ȓehna ḏi aya ȓweqṯ u s marra ṯimesȓayin. Aḏ yiȓi Siḏi Arebbi akiḏwem marra. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Sȓam-a wanita uriɣ-ṯ nec s ufus inu Bulus, ḏ ṯanita ḏ lƹalama inu iǧan ḏi marra ṯibraṯin inu. Ammu iy tariɣ nec. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ akiḏwem yiȓi marra.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>